`schedule 1 entry for writing` MEANS `Schedule 1 entry` OF "writing", includes, "writing includes any mode of representing or reproducing words in a visible form.", 1489, 1489

-- src:1490 | year, without specifying the type of year, means calendar year.
@ref Schedule 1, definition year (src:1490-1490)
`schedule 1 entry for year` MEANS `Schedule 1 entry` OF "year", means, "year, without specifying the type of year, means calendar year.", 1490, 1490

